usage: project_matrix.py [-h] --old OLD --core CORE --evidence EVIDENCE
                         --cache CACHE [--cases CASES] [--seed SEED]

Strict generated project/test comparisons, plus traced unchanged receipts. Run
under core-qualification.lock, after the frozen source's full old gate.
Retains every source, command and output; a mismatch stops before any
correction.

options:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
  --old OLD
  --core CORE
  --evidence EVIDENCE
  --cache CACHE
  --cases CASES
  --seed SEED
